  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "__BODMAS RULE__:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven: 15 + 5 - 10 × 8 ÷ 4 = 15\n\n**Option (1):** × and -\n\nAfter changing the symbols,\n\n⇒ 15 + 5 × 10 -__** 8 ÷ 4 **__= 15\n\n⇒ 15 + __**5 × 10**__ - 2 = 15\n\n⇒ __**15 + 50**__ - 2 = 15\n\n⇒ __**65 - 2 **__= 15\n\n⇒ **63 ****≠ 15**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (2):** ÷ and +\n\nAfter changing the symbols,\n\n⇒__** 15 ÷ 5 **__- 10 × 8 + 4 = 15\n\n⇒ 3 - __**10 × 8**__ + 4 = 15\n\n⇒ __**3**__ - 80 __**+ 4**__ = 15\n\n⇒ __**7 - 80**__ = 15\n\n⇒ **- 73 ****≠ 15**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (3):** ÷ and -\n\nAfter changing the symbols,\n\n⇒ 15 +__** 5 ÷ 10**__ × 8 - 4 = 15\n\n⇒ 15 + __**1/2 × 8 **__- 4 = 15\n\n⇒ __**15 + 4**__ - 4 = 15\n\n⇒__** 19 - 4**__ = 15\n\n⇒** 15 = 15**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option (4):** + and ×\n\nAfter changing the symbols,\n\n⇒ 15 × 5 - 10 +__** 8 ÷ 4**__ = 15\n\n⇒__** 15 × 5**__ - 10 + 2 = 15 \n\n⇒ __**75**__ - 10__** + 2**__ = 15\n\n⇒ __**77 - 10**__ = 15\n\n⇒ **67 ****≠ 15**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option (3)\".**",
